# =============================================================================
# Flamoral Dating Platform - Staging Environment Configuration Template
# =============================================================================
# Purpose: Pre-production testing environment that mirrors production configuration
# Security: Use test/sandbox credentials for third-party services
# This file should match production structure but with staging-specific values
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to .env.staging
#   2. Replace all *** placeholders with actual staging values
#   3. Use Azure Key Vault for sensitive staging credentials
#   4. Validate with: ./scripts/validate-env.sh staging
#
# Last Updated: 2025-12-11
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT SETTINGS
# =============================================================================

